                  "kind": "group",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "kind": "text",
                      "value": "(1) 叶结点数为 "
                    },
                    {
                      "kind": "math",
                      "value": "(k-1)m+1"
                    },
                    {
                      "kind": "text",
                      "value": "。"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "kind": "group",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "kind": "br",
                      "children": []
                    },
                    {
                      "kind": "text",
                      "value": "(2) 最多结点数为 "
                    },
                    {
                      "kind": "math",
                      "value": "∑_{j=1}^{h}k^{j-1}=(k^{h}-1)/(k-1)"
                    },
                    {
                      "kind": "text",
                      "value": "；最少结点数为 "
                    },
                    {
                      "kind": "math",
                      "value": "1+(h-1)k"
                    },
                    {
                      "kind": "text",
                      "value": "。"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "number": 43,
      "choice": null,
      "nodes": [
        {
          "kind": "group",
          "children": [
            {
              "kind": "p",
              "children": [
                {
                  "kind": "group",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "kind": "strong",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "kind": "text",
                          "value": "（1）算法基本设计思想"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "kind": "group",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "kind": "br",
                      "children": []
                    },
                    {
                      "kind": "text",
                      "value": "要使两个子集元素个数差最小且和的差最大，应将最小的⌊n/2⌋个元素放入A₁，其余放入A₂。采用快速排序中的划分思想，基于枢轴进行划分，通过非递归方式逐步将数组划分为两部分，使得左半部分恰好包含最小的⌊n/2⌋个元素，右半部分包含剩余元素。最后分别计算两部分的和并返回其差值。"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "kind": "p",
              "children": [
                {
                  "kind": "group",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "kind": "strong",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "kind": "text",
                          "value": "（2）算法描述（C语言）"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "kind": "code",
              "value": "int setPartition(int a[], int n) {\n    if (n <= 1) return n == 1 ? a[0] : 0;\n    int pivokey, low = 0, low0 = 0;\n    int high = n - 1, high0 = n - 1;\n    int flag = 1, k = n / 2, i;\n    int s1 = 0, s2 = 0;\n    while(flag) {\n        pivokey = a[low]; // 选择枢纽\n        while(low < high) {\n            while(low < high && a[high] >= pivokey) --high;\n            if(low != high) a[low] = a[high]; // 替换较大的数\n            while(low < high && a[low] <= pivokey) ++low;\n            if(low != high) a[high] = a[low]; // 替换较小的数\n        }\n        a[low] = pivokey; // 完成交换枢纽\n        if(low == k - 1) {\n            flag = 0;\n        } else {\n            if(low < k - 1) {\n                low0 = ++low;\n                high = high0;\n            } else {\n                high0 = --high;\n                low = low0;\n            }\n        }\n    }\n    for(i = 0; i < k; i++) s1 += a[i];\n    for(i = k; i < n; i++) s2 += a[i];\n    return s2 - s1;\n}",
              "block": true,
              "lang": "c"
            },
            {
              "kind": "p",
              "children": [
                {
                  "kind": "group",
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "kind": "strong",
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "kind": "text",
                          "value": "（3）时间复杂度与空间复杂度"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "kind": "list",
              "ordered": false,
              "items": [
                [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "平均时间复杂度为 O(n)；采用首元素作枢轴时，最坏时间复杂度为 O(n²)。  "
                  }
                ],
                [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "空间复杂度：O(1)，仅使用常数额外空间。"
                  }
                ]
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "number": 44,
      "choice": null,
      "nodes": [
        {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "**（1）字符传输**"
        },
        {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "每字符包含1位起始位、7位数据、1位奇校验、1位停止，共10位。每0.5 ms准备一个字符，每秒最多 $1/0.0005=2000$ 个。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "**（2）总耗时与CPU占用**"
        },
        {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "0.5 ms相当于25000个CPU周期。一次中断响应10周期，前15条服务指令耗时 $15\\times4=60$ 周期，然后启动下一个字符；末5条指令与设备准备重叠。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "1000个字符的总耗时约为 $1000\\times(25000+10+60)=25070000$ 个周期。若把最后5条指令单独计入，为25070020周期。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "CPU实际处理中断需 $1000\\times(10+20\\times4)=90000$ 个周期。"
        },
        {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "中断响应阶段由硬件关中断、保存断点和程序状态，并确定中断服务程序入口。"
        }
      ]
    },
